notes.content:
In this version was implemented:
- New mouse cursor with interactivity;
- Steam achievement system.

[b]News:[/b]
[list]
[*] Life stone: with it in your inventory, when you are defeated, you will have one more chance to fight;
[*] Minimap in the lower left corner, with indications of enemies and interactive objects;
[*] Inventory now contains all your items (before it only showed your weapons), along with a map so you don't get lost on your journey;
[*] Witch arena battles rebalanced for better fun.
[/list]
[b]Bugs fixed:[/b]
[list]
[*] Optimized main menu;
[*] Minor tweaks to Navmesh made.
[/list]
